{"id":"u153","kelas":"skill","no":4,"judul":"Temukan Kesalahan (2)","title":"Find the Mistake II","emoji":"🔎","ringkas":"Preposisi, kata hubung, kata ganti, dan tanda baca","ready":true,"goals":["menemukan kesalahan **preposisi, kata hubung, kata ganti, dan tanda baca**","memeriksa **perbandingan, pasif, dan present perfect**","mengenali kesalahan **kata benda tak terhitung** dan **kata sifat/keterangan**","mengedit paragraf pendek secara mandiri"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Latihan ini lebih sulit: kesalahannya ada pada **preposisi, kata hubung, kata ganti, perbandingan, pasif, present perfect**, dan tanda baca. Ketuk satu kalimat yang salah di setiap paragraf."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Kesalahan yang sering muncul","table":[["Jenis","Salah → Benar"],["Preposisi","[[depend of]] → [[depend on]]; [[good in]] → [[good at]]"],["Kata hubung","[[Although he was tired, but he worked.]] → buang but"],["Kata ganti","[[Me and her went.]] → [[She and I went.]]"],["Perbandingan","[[more taller]] → [[taller]]; [[the most best]] → [[the best]]"],["Pasif","[[The cake was ate.]] → [[was eaten]]"],["Present perfect","[[I have went]] → [[I have gone]]"],["Tak terhitung","[[many informations]] → [[a lot of information]]"],["Sifat/keterangan","[[He runs quick.]] → [[quickly]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Satu kalimat saja yang salah","text":"Hanya satu kalimat yang mengandung kesalahan. Jika kamu menemukan dua yang tampak janggal, periksa lagi mana yang benar-benar melanggar aturan."},{"t":"summary","items":["Preposisi tetap: depend on, good at.","Although tanpa but.","Perbandingan tanpa more + -er.","Pasif memakai V3.","Informasi tak terhitung."]}],"practice":[{"type":"spot","q":"Ketuk kalimat yang mengandung kesalahan.","items":["We will check it tomorrow.","If it rains, we will stay home.","The result depends of the weather.","The report says it will be sunny."],"answer":2,"exp":"depends on.","k":"9ac57934"},{"type":"spot","q":"Ketuk kalimat yang mengandung kesalahan.","items":[